Package: ggjbrowse
Title: Genome Browser Tracks as Data Frames for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Colin", "Diesh", email = "colindiesh@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads a region of a BAM or CRAM file as the 'JBrowse 2' genome
    browser draws it, through the browser's own data engine run in 'V8': the
    reads on their pileup rows, their mismatches, deletions and splice gaps,
    and the coverage, each as a data frame to plot with 'ggplot2'.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/GMOD/ggjbrowse
BugReports: https://github.com/GMOD/ggjbrowse/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    curl,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    jsonlite,
    V8
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
